msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = **10** for indoor use OR **6** for outdoors.  *This is the distance in meters that the rangefinder can reliably read.*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:37
#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tfmini-lidar.rst:51
